@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade - System Context

actor "End user\n(investor/trader)" as User
actor "Developer" as Dev

rectangle "EZTrade\nWeb trading platform" as System EZ_BACKEND {
  component "Frontend\nNext.js + React" as Frontend EZ_FRONTEND
  component "Backend\nSpring Boot + Spring Modulith" as Backend EZ_BACKEND
}

database "MySQL\nEZTrade database" as MySQL EZ_DB
component "Alpha Vantage API\nprices, search, overview, candles" as Alpha EZ_EXTERNAL
component "GitHub Actions\nBackend Maven CI" as GHA EZ_DEVOPS
component "Docker Compose\nlocal development runtime" as Compose EZ_DEVOPS

User --> Frontend : Browses, trades,\nreceives notifications
Frontend --> Backend : REST JSON\nJWT Bearer
Frontend --> Backend : WebSocket/STOMP\n/ws, /user/queue/notifications
Backend --> MySQL : JPA/Hibernate\nDDL auto update
Backend --> Alpha : HTTPS RestClient\nAPI key + throttle
Dev --> GHA : push / pull_request\nto main
GHA --> Backend : mvn -B clean verify\nworking-directory EZTrade/backend
Dev --> Compose : docker compose up --build
Compose --> Frontend : exposes localhost:3000
Compose --> Backend : exposes localhost:8088
Compose --> MySQL : exposes localhost:3306

note right of System
Evidence: frontend/package.json, frontend/lib/api-client.ts,
backend/pom.xml, application.properties, .env.example,
AlphaVantageAPI.java, docker-compose.yml,
Dockerfiles, and ../.github/workflows/maven.yml.
end note

note bottom of Compose
Compose starts MySQL, backend, and frontend for local development.
Production deployment manifests or IaC are not declared in the repository.
end note

@enduml
